msgid "about"
msgstr ""

#: app/views/about.scm:335
msgid ""
"How byggsteg came to be: how NalaGinrut showed Josep Bigorra the world GNU "
"Artanis opened, and why byggsteg is an infinitely extensible CI/CD system -- "
"a job is data, a task is a name, and a step is a procedure you write"
